=== P2 md ===
# P-2: Risk-Adjusted Metrics & Capital Efficiency

**Status:** IMPLEMENTED (local, evidence-gated)
**Package:** PROFIT-1 P-2 (sections 6, 8, 18)
**Generation model:** Append-only immutable ResearchGenerationRecord + StrategyRiskMetricRecord
**Accounting scope:** FULL_LIFECYCLE (default), WINDOW_FLOW supported
**Metric schema version:** 1.0.0 | Algorithm version:** 1.0.0

## Implemented metrics (per strategy/account dimension)
- Sample counts (n_positions, n_wins, n_losses, n_flat, n_days), exclusions_count
- Position R: net_r_mean, net_r_median (only when risk_capital > 0); exclusions tracked
- Cost-to-risk: (fees + P-1 matched slippage_drag - signed_funding) / initial_risk_capital using SlippageAttributionRecord
- Profit factor (UNDEFINED_NO_LOSSES when gross_losses == 0), win rate, payoff ratio
- Drawdown/underwater: max_drawdown_pct from equity high-water mark, time_underwater_pct, TWAE with bounded carry-forward (max_carry_forward_age_seconds, default 86400)
- Capital efficiency: turnover, net_return_on_equity, net_pnl_per_risk_capital, notional_per_initial_risk_capital; margin fields NULL with reason NOT_RECORDED_IN_LEDGER if not present
- ESS: Bartlett-style autocorrelation-lag floor n/4 with clamping; method BARTLETT_AUTOCORRELATION_LAG_FLOOR_N_DIV_4; sufficiency gates (>=20 days AND ESS>=20) enforced, reasons recorded

## Idempotency & isolation
- request_payload_hash + idempotency_key; IdempotencyConflictException returns 409
- Generates per primary paper account (independent 8-account reporting preserved)
- No ledger writes; read-only recomputation from source records
- Queue/heartbeat semantics aligned with research pattern; generation status RUNNING/SUCCEEDED/FAILED

## API
- GET /api/v1/research/profitability/risk-capital-metrics?accounting_scope=FULL_LIFECYCLE|WINDOW_FLOW
- POST /api/v1/research/profitability/generations/p2 (research.token)

## Evidence
- See P2_evidence.json (nulls for unavailable values; no fabricated zeros/UUIDs)
- Migrations applied to isolated test DB only (bybit_test on :25432); production untouched

## Limitations
- Some exposure/margin series may be NULL until recorded in ledger
- TWAE coverage gaps tracked and capped by carry-forward age
- Statistical sufficiency gates are thresholds for eligibility, not proof of expectancy
