- Archive is bounded/best-effort (`BOUNDED_BEST_EFFORT_NOT_REPEATABLE_READ`, mutable position snapshots); 38 positions over 24 h are descriptive only, never a profitability claim.
- SQLite decimal columns return unnormalized strings such as `10`; DB-level tests compare via `BigDecimal::of(...)->isEqualTo(...)`, not string equality.

