- A0: immutable candidate registry (problem statement, evidence population, precommitted null hypothesis, net-after-cost metric, train/OOS/forward splits, familywise experiment count, data quality + sample coverage). The Go registry in `research-go/internal/candidates/registry.go` is the seed; mirror it in the PHP domain if A1 needs it.
